          "description_mirror": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Take your AI idea from prototype to working product at the ",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "AMD Developer Hackathon: ACT III in Milan",
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ".",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "This hackathon brings together developers, founders, engineers, students, and AI builders to create high-performance applications and agents using ",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "AMD GPUs in the cloud",
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ".",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "attrs": {
                  "level": 2
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "The challenge",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Build an end-to-end ",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "AI application, agent, or developer tool powered by AMD technology",
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ".",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Participants will get the opportunity to work with:",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "bullet_list",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "text": "Cloud-accessible AMD GPUs",
                            "type": "text"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "text": "The ROCm open-source software stack",
                            "type": "text"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "text": "AI and machine learning development resources",
                            "type": "text"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "text": "Technical guidance from mentors and industry experts",
                            "type": "text"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "text": "Training and learning materials from the AMD ecosystem",
                            "type": "text"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Everything runs in the cloud. You do not need to own AMD hardware or complete a complex local setup before you begin.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "You can explore AI agents, model training and fine-tuning, workload benchmarking, developer tooling, high-performance machine learning, or an original use case of your own. Detailed tracks will be announced before the kickoff.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "attrs": {
                  "level": 2
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Build at SmartCityLab Milano",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "The Milan on-site experience will take place at ",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "SmartCityLab Milano",
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", an innovation hub where technology, sustainability, and design come together to turn ideas into practical projects.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Over the weekend, you\u2019ll have space to:",
                    "type": "text"
